            {
                "ID": "erav_ntr_mia_release",
                "_comment": "selfReleaseEventID of expedition_erav_ntr_mia (and the Part 3 client type defs). Job_Expedition.TickSelfRelease banks it in the MIA party's log once the captives' own expedition progress or the DurationHour countdown reaches 0; the player opens it from the MIA list after every other banked event of the party is resolved (or it runs at once with immediateRunExpeditionEvent). Played like any banked event: self = player, Targets[victims] = every captive. The setup branch copies self into Targets[supervisor] (listener of the return kojo) and fetches the kojo before the lines display; no kojo found -> the narration-only path. TeleportToFaction must run before ReleaseFromMIA (releasing the last captive deletes the MIA party and its room). TODO: numeric settlement, per client type text (Part 3).",
